{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitch","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitch","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitch","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitch","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L74-L106","doc":"**SDP dual block is positive semidefinite** ([`prop:sdp-regime-switch`]).\n\nFor every conjugate pair `(l, l')` the `2×2` dual block is PSD: its\nquadratic form is non-negative for every test vector `(x₀, x₁)`,\n\n  `d·x₀² + 2c·x₀x₁ + d'·x₁² ≥ 0`,   `d := μ_l − y₀ − y_l`, etc.\n\n**Derived** (Sylvester) from the dual-feasibility inputs `diag_nonneg`\n(`d, d' ≥ 0`) and `det_cond` (`c² ≤ dd'`) — the genuine\nsemidefiniteness of the block, not a restatement of the scalar slacks.\nProof: for `d > 0`, `d·Q = (d·x₀ + c·x₁)² + (dd' − c²)·x₁² ≥ 0`; for\n`d = 0`, `c² ≤ 0` forces `c = 0` and `Q = d'·x₁² ≥ 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:sdp-regime-switch","label":"prop:sdp-regime-switch","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/sdp-regime-switch.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.det_cond","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.det_cond","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Dual feasibility (determinant slack ≥ 0): the product of diagonals\ndominates the squared coupling. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.diag_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.diag_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L66-L66","doc":"Dual feasibility (diagonal slack ≥ 0): the `2×2` block diagonal\nentries `μ − y₀ − y` are non-negative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.c_couple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.c_couple","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L63-L63","doc":"Per-conjugate-pair coupling `c_{λλ'}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.y","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.y","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Per-partition LP-dual variables `y_λ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.y_0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.y_0","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L59-L59","doc":"LP-dual variable `y_0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.μ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.μ","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Per-partition q-Laplacian eigenvalue `μ_λ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.N","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.Z","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.q","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The substrate parameter `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.SDPRegimeSwitchContext","kind":"class","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/SDPRegimeSwitch.lean#L45-L72","doc":"Dual-feasibility data for the SDP regime-switch block. All fields are\n*inputs* (the SDP solution and its slack); the block's\npositive-semidefiniteness is **derived** in `SDPRegimeSwitch`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}